{"record_id": "tj_license_implementation", "role": "assistant", "phase": "commentary", "timestamp_utc": "2026-11-02T13:45:21.547Z", "model_recorded_in_turn_context": "gpt-6.1-sol", "extraction": "contiguous_verbatim_excerpt", "character_offsets": [0, 79], "offset_unit": "unicode_codepoints", "text": "收到。团队自研部分按规划采用 MIT；第三方代码和厂商 IP 保留各自条款，并继续逐项核对。XDL 的真实 AI 协作记录会列为“未交付项”，不会代写补齐。\n", "text_sha256": "8bfa5a18083612311c952d4a0d76eb251ac5d44d9927e17dedab92f86568f136", "original_message_sha256": "8bfa5a18083612311c952d4a0d76eb251ac5d44d9927e17dedab92f86568f136", "source_log_line": 289, "source_line_sha256": "c31a7a15a5e5f0273bc035742ec94d4c0d427fceeeda731946c3451e8b61c6d7"}
